\subsection{Power Flow Calculation}
\label{sec.power_flow}
%
%The power flow solution is essential if the small-signal study wants to be carried out efficiently. The result of the power flow is used to calculate the linearization point and to initialize the non-linear model simulation.  
%
The operations of \ac{stamp} start by solving a power flow problem, whose solution is subsequently used in two ways, as illustrated in Fig.~\ref{fig.overview}.
%
Firstly, it is used for the calculation of the equilibrium point around which the system is linearised.
%
