This case study aims to showcase the capability of \ac{stamp} to perform analysis on AC/DC hybrid power systems
%, i.e., systems with both AC and DC parts.
%
and is based on the real-world HVDC interconnection between Spain and France, termed the INELFE link~\cite{francos2012inelfe}.
