Fig.~\ref{fig:inelfe_scheme} shows the schematic of the system under study.
%
It is comprised of an HVDC link, two \acp{ipc}, rated at 1000~MW, 400~kV each, a double transmission line, an inductive load, and two Thevenin circuits, representing the two interconnected AC networks. 
%
\ac{ipc}-1 regulates the DC voltage at the HVDC link while \ac{ipc}-2 controls the active and reactive power interchanged with the AC grid.
