Quantum models offer an attractive alternative to classical ML techniques \cite{10398184}, harnessing their ability to detect complex and intricate patterns by operating in a higher-dimensional computational space enabled by the principles of superposition and entanglement. These inherent quantum properties streamline enhanced feature representation and the exploration of complex data structures, offering the potential to address challenges such as imbalanced datasets \cite{tudiscoevaluating2024}, a prevalent issue in healthcare applications.

